{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe game allows for custom buttons, including the controller and keyboard and mouse, and the controller has vibration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bIf the controller does not respond, please follow the following settings: right-click the game name \u2192 Properties \u2192 Controller \u2192 Use default settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010The game currently has two stages, and Stage 3 will be updated in early 2026. The original price will increase as more content is added.\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLASHING NIGHT</strong> is an indie pure action game developed and self-published by me using Unity, in a Devil May Cry-like style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Players can quickly switch weapons and perform combos both on the ground and in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System:</strong> Magic Shield and Perfect Dodge slow down enemy actions, providing opportunities for counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Features:</strong> Use enemy stomps, double jumps, teleportation, and aerial dodges to perform flashy air combos. Use magic to unleash high-damage skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game aims to deliver fast-paced, high-speed, and free combat experiences, combining a rich and deep combat system with skill-learning mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows custom key bindings and supports both controllers and keyboard &amp; mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic shield and perfect dodge can slow down the enemy's movements. Take this opportunity to counterattack the enemy!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/cf7da4c4118abef00c3c7f39c2dd7d16.poster.avif?t=1757526850\" width=450 height=254 ><sourc